      <h1>Building an open-source AI media studio with App Composer</h1>
      <p class="deck">I described a studio I wanted to own. Get Ready checked the machine, Init wrote a specification I could read, and my agent built and deployed it as its own Cloudflare application. This is what it does, how it is put together, what it cost, and how the studio then made the artwork and vertical motion on this page.</p>
